 # 45\. Product Principle

 The core architectural principle for Turf shall be:

 > **The booking system must work independently of the 3D map.**

 The 3D subsystem is a future discovery and navigation experience.

 Therefore:

```
                    Turf

             ┌───────────────┐
             │ Booking Core  │
             │               │
             │ Users         │
             │ Turfs         │
             │ Availability  │
             │ Bookings      │
             │ Payments      │
             └───────┬───────┘
                     │
              ┌──────┴──────┐
              │             │
           2D Map        Future 3D
                         Experience
```

 This prevents the project from becoming overly complicated during the MVP while preserving the long-term vision.

